 // =========================================================================== building
 
+// EVERY WINDOW IN THE HOUSE FOLLOWS THE STYLE. poh_dynamic_window is a multiloc over
+// poh_window_state, and %poh_window is the one number that feeds it: style * 9 + the glazing you
+// have fitted. This is the only thing that writes it, and it has to run whenever either half
+// changes - which today means buying a house and redecorating one.
+//
+// The choice is recovered from the old value rather than stored twice: modulo 9 is the glazing, and
+// dividing by 9 was the old style.
+[proc,poh_window_refresh]
